PalletTown_Museum_Text_Curator::
    .string "Welcome to the GRENALUX MUSEUM!\p"
    .string "Our pride is the GRENAT, a gem that\n"
    .string "hums when a POKéMON's AURA is near.\p"
    .string "Legend says the GRENAT is tied to\n"
    .string "JIRACHI's wish. Ten years ago, the\l"
    .string "AURA changed every POKéMON's type...\p"
    .string "Funny how nobody knows why.$"

PalletTown_Museum_Text_OldMan::
    .string "I remember when FIRE POKéMON were\n"
    .string "only FIRE. Now look at them...\p"
    .string "The world turned upside down, and\n"
    .string "all I did was grow old.$"

PalletTown_Museum_Text_GarnetCase::
    .string "The GRENAT.\n"
    .string "A deep red gem that glows faintly\l"
    .string "when POKéMON gather near.$"

PalletTown_Museum_Text_AuraCase::
    .string "The AURA of ten years ago.\n"
    .string "Records show every POKéMON's type\l"
    .string "changed in a single night.$"
